      "minimal_repair": "Within cli_arguments.py, reserve bounded structural and character work for direct invocation fields before their Unicode/byte scan, copying, typed reconstruction or serialization. Keep the canonical-root substitution, deterministic IDs, schema ownership and fixed error contract unchanged; do not change accepted ReportBudget/service implementations.",
      "required_controls": [
        "A direct carrier with a long retained root and insufficient work must refuse before its character scan, copy or encoder/hash invocation; use deterministic counts.",
